NEW rhythms, new people and lots more fun begins May 27th.  Adults and children aged 8+ are guaranteed 5 weeks of fun! Don't miss the pre-sale special of $79 which can be purchased [here](/product/5-drumming-classes-sunshine-coast/ "NEW 5 week course May 27th")[![Drumming Lessons Noosa](/media/2014/03/the-j.jpg)](/media/2014/03/the-j.jpg) NEW locations and times listed below: Maroochydore @ SOLBAR 4.45-5.45pm Wednesdays starting May 28th Palmwoods @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall 6-7pm Tuesdays starting May 27th Noosa @ The J 6-7pm Mondays starting June 2nd [![solbar](/media/2013/11/solbar.jpg)](/media/2013/11/solbar.jpg)
